WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.968
♪♪

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.801
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]
-Now, let's get to the news.

00:00:05.801 --> 00:00:09.033
After House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy denied reports

00:00:09.033 --> 00:00:12.834
that he had planned to ask
former President Trump to resign

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:15.234
in the wake of the Capitol
attack, The New York Times

00:00:15.234 --> 00:00:19.400
released audio of McCarthy
telling colleagues he was going

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.300
to talk to Trump
about stepping down.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.367
Alright, well, you know,
I'm sure he wouldn't lie.

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:25.868
It was probably just
a misunderstanding.
Let's hear it.

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:35.601
Oh, alright, well,
that's pretty damning.

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:37.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.400
That'd be like the
"Encanto" family saying,

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.667
"We always talk about Bruno."

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:45.734
After new audio revealed

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:48.767
that House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy was planning

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.133
to urge former President Trump

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:52.167
to resign
after the Capitol attack,

00:00:52.167 --> 00:00:55.968
Trump said that he thinks it was
"A big compliment."

00:00:55.968 --> 00:00:58.300
So we should just add "resign"

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.467
to the list of the words
he doesn't know?

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:02.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:03.734
"Mr. President,
you need to resign."

00:01:03.734 --> 00:01:05.601
[ As Trump] Thank you,
I have been working out.

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:07.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.634
Politico published photographs
on Friday

00:01:09.634 --> 00:01:12.834
that appear to show Republican
Congressman Madison Cawthorn

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:14.434
wearing lingerie at a party.

00:01:14.434 --> 00:01:16.601
And I would say this is
embarrassing for him,

00:01:16.601 --> 00:01:19.200
except he looks amazing.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.734 --> 00:01:23.734
Plus, I don't think this story
will last,

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:25.968
because if you Google "Madison"
and "lingerie,"

00:01:25.968 --> 00:01:28.267
this isn't even
on the first 12 pages.

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:29.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:30.868
I was told!

00:01:30.868 --> 00:01:35.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:38.200
Baze, you got to tell her you
wrote that joke, Baze.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.734
If she calls the office, Baze,
you got to take credit for it.

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:44.501
While speaking in Seattle
on Friday

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:46.901
to commemorate Earth Day,
President Biden said

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:48.901
that the Republican Party
has changed and added,

00:01:48.901 --> 00:01:51.634
