Republican Party."

00:01:51.634 --> 00:01:54.567
Yes. And it certainly isn't
your father's Republican Party,

00:01:54.567 --> 00:01:56.501
because they nominated Lincoln.

00:01:56.501 --> 00:01:58.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:01.033
During his -- some people have
been critical, said,

00:02:01.033 --> 00:02:03.634
"You got to stop making jokes
about how Biden's

00:02:03.634 --> 00:02:05.534
