00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:12.100
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:18.234
Problem solved.

00:02:18.234 --> 00:02:20.200
During his rally in Ohio
over the weekend,

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.200
former President Trump appeared
to see himself

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.501
on one of the screens and said,
"What a handsome president."

00:02:25.501 --> 00:02:27.834
Here, I think
we have some footage.

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:30.133
-Pretty bird.

00:02:30.133 --> 00:02:31.667
Pretty bird.

00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:36.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:38.267
-At the same rally,
former President Trump said

00:02:38.267 --> 00:02:40.133
that he didn't like
being called stupid,

00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:42.601
so he asked then-White House
doctor Ronny Jackson

00:02:42.601 --> 00:02:44.400
to give him a test to prove
his intelligence.

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:47.367
And this is cool --
the other side had a menu.

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:50.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:53.367
Trump also said that
water pressure regulations

00:02:53.367 --> 00:02:57.167
cause problems with the,
"third element of a bathroom,

00:02:57.167 --> 00:02:59.834
so people have to flush toilets
up to 10 times."

00:02:59.834 --> 00:03:02.701
Of course, when Trump says
he has to go number three,

00:03:02.701 --> 00:03:05.267
it means he's flushing
classified documents.

00:03:05.267 --> 00:03:07.133
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.133 --> 00:03:09.167
[ As Trump ]
Mel, don't go in there!

00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:10.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.734 --> 00:03:14.033
Do not --
A lot of call logs, Mel.

00:03:14.033 --> 00:03:15.400
'Cause I don't know how
the shredder works.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:16.734
We've had this conversation.

00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:19.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:24.200
A city in Michigan
yesterday appointed

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:27.033
a cat named Jinx as the mayor
for a day.

00:03:27.033 --> 00:03:28.400
It was all fun and games

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.767
until Jinx signed
an executive order

00:03:30.767 --> 00:03:33.033
implementing
a nightly fireworks show.

00:03:33.033 --> 00:03:36.033
[ Laughter and awws ]

00:03:38.601 --> 00:03:40.634
Alright, we could have gotten
a dog that looked more

00:03:40.634 --> 00:03:43.434
like a dickhead.
That is --

00:03:43.434 --> 00:03:45.968
And finally, firefighters
in Washington State last week

00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:48.467
rescued a woman
after she fell headfirst

00:03:48.467 --> 00:03:50.100
into an outhouse toilet,

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.501
trying to retrieve
her cellphone, which is crazy,

00:03:52.501 --> 00:03:54.400
because it was an Android.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.167
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:56.601
♪♪

00:03:56.601 --> 00:04:00.100
