leave something behind
after the breakup

00:11:07.834 --> 00:11:10.200
to give you an excuse
to go back.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:13.801
"Yeah, hey, did I leave
some Humvees over there?"

00:11:13.801 --> 00:11:14.968
[ Laughter ]

00:11:14.968 --> 00:11:16.100
According to a new poll,

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:18.200
nearly 80% of Americans
are concerned

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:21.100
about misinformation influencing
the outcome of November's

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:24.701
midterm elections, and about 35%
are counting on it.

00:11:24.701 --> 00:11:26.200
[ Laughter ]

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:27.968
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:11:27.968 --> 00:11:30.968
and House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
today announced a new plan

00:11:30.968 --> 00:11:32.133
to lower gas prices.

00:11:32.133 --> 00:11:34.434
It's essentially a new gas pump

00:11:34.434 --> 00:11:37.767
where every third gallon
is just Arizona iced tea.

00:11:37.767 --> 00:11:39.501
[ Laughter ]

00:11:39.501 --> 00:11:42.000
Russian President Vladimir Putin
said yesterday that,

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.067
if any country interferes
with his attack on Ukraine,

00:11:45.067 --> 00:11:47.968
"they must know our response
to counterstrikes will be

00:11:47.968 --> 00:11:50.067
lightning-fast,
unless, of course,

00:11:50.067 --> 00:11:52.133
there's a little bit of mud."

00:11:52.133 --> 00:11:54.367
[ Laughter ]

00:11:54.367 --> 00:11:56.701
A family in Illinois
recently found a bag

00:11:56.701 --> 00:11:58.968
of McDonald's French fries,
while renovating their home,

00:11:58.968 --> 00:12:01.567
that may have been in the wall
for more than 60 years.

00:12:01.567 --> 00:12:04.901
Man! It is hard to believe
that, 60 years ago,

00:12:04.901 --> 00:12:07.434
those fries were hot
for three minutes.

00:12:07.434 --> 00:12:10.100
[ Laughter ]

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:13.300
And finally, the NFL Draft kicks
off tonight in Las Vegas,

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:16.033
where 31 lucky players
will avoid the Jets.

00:12:16.033 --> 00:12:18.434
And that, you guys,
was a monologue.

00:12:18.434 --> 00:12:22.033
♪♪

00:12:22.033 --> 00:12:23.701
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

